# Citation metadata for GitHub's "Cite this repository" button and for citation
# tools. The preferred citation is the JOSS paper; it is the same reference as
# the BibTeX block in README.md, and the author list and ORCIDs come from the
# front matter of docs/paper.md. Keep the three in step.
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use D2S in your research, please cite the JOSS paper below."
type: software
title: "Data to Science (D2S)"
abstract: "An open-source web platform for managing, visualizing, and sharing geospatial data, particularly uncrewed aerial system (UAS) data, with a Python client (d2spy) and a QGIS plugin (D2S Browser)."
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/gdslab/data-to-science"
url: "https://d2s.org"
keywords:
  - geospatial data management
  - uncrewed aerial system
  - UAV
  - remote sensing
  - open science
